data: {"id": "788ecf050d344318-thinking-parallel_evidence-1435", "run_id": "788ecf050d344318", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "所有工具已执行完成。汇总证据：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 生命周期状态 (kubectl_describe + kubectl_get_yaml)\n- **Phase**: Pending\n- **Container State**: Waiting, Reason=ImagePullBackOff\n- **Node**: node2 (10.2.0.50), Pod IP=172.16.104.37\n- **Restart Count**: 0\n- **Image**: `registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908`, imagePullPolicy=Always\n- **imagePullSecrets**: **absent** (YAML 中不存在)\n\n### 2. Kubernetes Events (kubectl_events)\n核心错误事件（33m 前发生，重复 x4 over 34m）：\n```\nFailed ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789443229416, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

