data: {"id": "788ecf050d344318-final", "run_id": "788ecf050d344318", "seq": 1440, "ts_ms": 1789443246756, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v07/workload` | ImagePullBackOff | 镜像 'registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908' 在远程仓库中不存在（404 NotFound），导致 kubelet 反复拉取失败并进入 ImagePullBackOff 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | `aiops-case-v07/workload` | 状态 `Pending`，阶段 `PodScheduled` (True) 但 `Ready` (False) | 确认 Pod 调度成功但启动失败 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `aiops-case-v07/workload` | 容器 `app` 状态 `waiting`，原因 `ImagePullBackOff`，消息 \"Back-off pulling image...\" | 直接反映镜像拉取失败后的退避状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | 事件 `Failed` (Over 34m x6)：`rpc error: code = NotFound desc = failed to pull and unpack image ... pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908: not found` | 核心故障证据，明确指出镜像 Tag 不存在 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason: ImagePullBackOff) 采样值 `1` | 从监控侧确认容器持续处于拉取失败状态 |\n\n**证据小结**：\nK8s 事件 `fact-2217fd7a557f` 直接揭示了远程仓库返回 404 (NotFound) 的根本原因。K8s 状态 `fact-ed9ce5e214db` 与 Prometheus 指标 `fact-2de0cec98385` 均证实容器从 `ErrImagePull` 进入了 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态，这与事件序列（拉取失败 → 退避）完全一致，排除了集群资源不足等其他启动失败因素。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n镜像 Tag 不存在 (NotFound) → kubelet 拉取失败 (rpc error) → Pod 进入 ImagePullBackOff 退避状态 → Pod 持续 Pending，容器未运行\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是工作负载 `aiops-case-v07/workload` 配置的镜像 `registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908` 在远程仓库中不存在（返回 404 NotFound）。\n\n该直接原因导致 kubelet 在拉取镜像时失败，Pod 状态由 `Pending` 进入 `ImagePullBackOff` 并持续重试退避（见证据 1、2、3），最终表现为应用容器无法启动（见证据 4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 10.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 46.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v07/workload: 46.6s (Evidence 37.9s, RCA 8.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v07/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 65.646, "metrics": {"run_id": "788ecf050d344318", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 65.6528673171997, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 65652.8673171997, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 60803.59125137329, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 13152.47392654419, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4456.035375595093}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 10428.917407989502, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence":